# 商家接口手工测试（VS Code REST Client / Apifox 导入）
# 先启动应用，数据库有用户与种子数据；除登录外接口均需 JWT。

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@token = 粘贴登录返回的 token

### 1. 登录（获取 token）
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "你的手机号或邮箱",
  "password": "你的密码"
}

### 2. 入驻申请
POST {{baseUrl}}/merchant/insert
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "shopName": "测试食堂窗口",
  "campusArea": "一食堂",
  "address": "一楼东侧",
  "contactPhone": "13800138000",
  "description": "课设测试店铺"
}

### 3. 我的店铺列表（店主）
GET {{baseUrl}}/merchant/mine
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. 按条件查询（Body）
POST {{baseUrl}}/merchant/listByCondition
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "shopName": "食堂",
  "pageNum": 1,
  "pageSize": 10
}

### 5. 用户端店铺列表（仅审核通过且营业中）
GET {{baseUrl}}/merchant/list
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. 按 ID 查询
GET {{baseUrl}}/merchant/get/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. 更新店铺（须为 owner，body 带 id）
PUT {{baseUrl}}/merchant/update
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1,
  "shopName": "新店名",
  "description": "更新说明"
}

### 8. 逻辑删除
PUT {{baseUrl}}/merchant/delete/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
